# Static assets.
#
# A photograph dropped in here can become the intro plate: put the file
# alongside this one and point `intro.photo` in content/intro.ts at it, e.g.
# "/harbour.png". It is quantised to the six inks in the browser, so it comes
# out screened to match the drawing rather than sitting next to it.
#
# It has to live here rather than on a remote URL — the dither reads pixels back
# out of a canvas, which only works same-origin.
